 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "MM3Z2V0 to MM3Z75: 200 mW silicon zener diodes, 2.0 V to 75 V, SOD-323",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "Thirty-eight silicon zener diodes for surface mounting in the two-lead SOD-323 package, rated 200 mW, with nominal zener voltages from 2.0 V to 75 V. Each type has a zener voltage window, a maximum impedance at two currents, a maximum reverse leakage and a typical temperature coefficient. MM3Z5V1 is the 5.1 V type: 4.8 V to 5.4 V at 5 mA, marked 0A. The named uses are voltage references in regulated supplies and overvoltage protection.",
